Package: OmicsAtlasBulk
Title: Bulk RNA-seq Pipeline for the OmicsAtlas Project
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Nosakhare Odionfo", "Osaro", , "osaronosakhare@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Alignment orchestration (STAR), quantification (featureCounts
    via Rsubread), differential expression (DESeq2 and edgeR run in
    parallel with an explicit method-comparison step), functional
    enrichment (clusterProfiler GO/KEGG/GSEA), and BayesPrism
    deconvolution against the OmicsAtlas scRNA-seq signature, for the bulk
    RNA-seq arm of the OmicsAtlas project (see the parent repository for
    full context).
